- Functional and visual spot coverage was completed across all seeded roles: `ADMIN`, `MANAGER`, `ACCOUNTANT`, `DRIVER`, `FORWARDER`, `CUSTOMER`, and a temporary `CLERK` user `qa-clerk-2126`.
