# Phase 4 treasury review fixes

## Result

Implemented the treasury/refund blockers from `qa/2026-07-31_customer-service-finance_code-review.md` within the assigned scope.

- Governed receipt refunds now snapshot the canonical receipt inflow and atomically append one opposite treasury movement per refund receipt version.
- Treasury reversal is append-only: the original remains `POSTED`, the opposite movement is appended, and IN/OUT balances return to neutral.
- Setup, cutover, and reversal routes use required header idempotency with stable endpoint namespaces; cutover and reversal require expected versions.
- Additive migration `0169_lively_sabra.sql` supports canonical-source uniqueness plus versioned partial reversals and repairs legacy mutable-reversal status rows.
