# Current Code Authority: Customer-Service to Finance Lifecycle

## Scope Note

User authority chain for this research:

`Booking / intake -> Customer Service -> Điều vận -> Phát sinh chi phí -> CUS kiểm tra chi phí -> Debit Note draft -> accountant approval -> issue -> invoice / statement -> AR collection -> AP settlement -> pass-through chi hộ / thu hộ -> profitability -> CEO dashboard`

