## Bottom Line

The codebase already contains most of the financial authority needed for the requested lifecycle. The missing work is not a new ledger model. It is a thin orchestration/workspace layer that connects existing authoritative services in the right user sequence.

Strongest existing authority:

1. Shipment intake and document lifecycle.
2. Debit-note issuance / adjustment governance.
