## What Is Actually Implemented

### Shipment intake and documents

This is already a real lifecycle, not a stub.

- Shipments have a legal status machine with DRAFT -> IN_PROGRESS -> DELIVERED -> CLOSED, plus terminal CANCELED. The service writes append-only status history and supports versioned updates and soft delete.
- The shipment route exposes create, quick-create, detail, transition, dispatch, document attach/replace, container reconcile, declaration upsert, and change-request review.
- Dispatch creates a linked trip, snapshots containers, and emits side effects/notifications.

