### Debit note / billing-document authority

This is the strongest single finance authority in the repo after ledger posting.

- Draft issue is guarded by governance action creation and source-drift checks.
- Issue application locks customer ledger authority, rechecks period writability, locks source trips/expenses, and transitions the document to SENT.
- Adjustments post delta entries rather than mutating the old document in place.
- The schema keeps immutable snapshots for template, identity, due dates, and authority state.

