### AR collection and credit control

This part is mature.

- Customer receivable snapshots are built from issued billing documents, source trip/expense lines, adjustments, and payment allocations.
- Payment allocation supports explicit instructions and oldest-due fallback with unapplied cash preserved as unapplied, not as negative AR.
- Reminder service already has a time window, retry schedule, dispute suppression, and business-day behavior.
- Credit-limit service has warning thresholds, pending exposure, approved-uncollected computation, and tiered overrides.

