`docs/BIẾU MẪU BÁO CÁO/` against the running app, and write a structured gap
analysis to `docs/customer-workflow-gap-analysis.md`. This is a **read + write
docs** phase: no product code changes, no data mutation.

## Requirements

- Functional: produce an auditable gap-analysis doc covering (a) every report
  template, column-by-column, with app status and gap; (b) the master-data
  entities and whether the app can represent each field; (c) the dispatch
  workflow implied by CUS-ĐIỀU XE vs what the app does today.
- Non-functional: the doc must be reviewable by a non-coder (customer-facing)
  and precise enough to scope the deferred reporting plan.

## Architecture

No code changes. Inputs: the three Excel workbooks (already parsed to
`/tmp/cust-xlsx/*.txt` during planning), the current schema
(`backend/src/db/schema.ts`), and the report/finance implementation map from
the planning scouts. Output: one Markdown doc.

## Audit findings (already established during planning)

### Report templates — status matrix

| # | Customer report | App status | Key gaps |
|---|-----------------|------------|----------|
| 1 | BC LÃI Lỗ (P&L + trend + cost pie + debt reminders) | **Partial** | P&L + trend + cost pie exist (`FinancePage`, `pnl.service.ts`). Debt-reminder widgets (near-due/overdue) live on Dashboard, not the finance page. No Excel/PDF export. |
| 2 | TH VẬN TẢI (transport summary ledger → reconciliation → Debit Note export) | **Missing** | No standalone report. Has the data (`computeTripTotals`, `tripDetails`) and Debit Note export infra, but no reconciliation-ledger page, no multi-select "XÁC NHẬN XHĐ" → AR/AP post, no per-customer Debit Note Excel download from that flow. |
| 3 | BC HÀNG NGÀY (daily P&L, xe ngoài vs xe nhà, cost-as-%of-revenue, green/red margin) | **Missing** | No daily report. Own/external split exists in P&L; cost sub-categories (Lương CB / Xăng dầu / Lương chuyến+LH / Vé / Khấu hao as % of revenue) and >=50% green / <50% red coloring do not exist. |
| 4 | BÁO CÁO CÔNG NỢ THEO THÁNG (row-level monthly AR/AP aging) | **Partial** | Aging buckets + per-customer ledger exist (`DebtListPage`, `aging.service.ts`, Excel aging export). Missing: row-level table (mã nội bộ, MST, ngày phát sinh, hạn TT, ngày đến hạn, số HĐ, tiền HĐ, chi hộ, đã TT, còn lại, ngày TT thực tế, 6-level trạng thái cảnh báo), Gmail remind action. |
| 5 | BÁO CÁO TÌNH TRẠNG KH (customer status: aging ratios + top on-time + top overdue) | **Partial** | Aging buckets + top overdue exist. Missing: dedicated page, aging as count+ratio, top on-time payers ranking. |
| 6 | LN THÁNG (monthly income statement, admin only) | **Missing** | No 5-section income statement (Doanh thu / Chi phí vendor+định+biến+tài chính / LN trước thuế / Thuế / LN sau thuế). No tax computation. |

### Master-data entities — representability

| Excel sheet | App home | Status |
|-------------|----------|--------|
| THÔNG TIN NCC (suppliers, e.g. Long Minh) | `suppliers` + `customers` (carrier linked via `linkedSupplierId`) | Representable. Long Minh is both a customer (cargo owner) and the debit-note recipient. |
| THÔNG TIN KH (customers) | `customers` | Representable. |
| NHÀ MÁY (factories: NEWEB, ASKEY, SUNRISE, SJ Tech, S-CONNECT) | `cargoTypes` is wrong fit; closest is reference data / shipment `factoryName`. | **Gap:** no dedicated "factory/site" entity. Factories live as free-text `shipments.factoryName` and inside operational notes. Document as a representability gap; do not re-architect in this plan. |
| TUYẾN ĐƯỜNG (routes) | `routes` | Representable. |
| LOẠI HÌNH XE (trucks w/ BKS + romooc + driver + tonnage) | `trucks`, `trailers`, `drivers` | Representable. BKS → `trucks.plateNumber`; romooc → `trailers`; tonnage → `trucks.payloadCapacity`. |
| MẪU BÁO GIÁ (pricing by customer × cargo size × route) | `pricing_tables`, `weight_pricing_tiers`, `fuel_config`, `fuel_norms` | Representable. The pricing grid (1.25T…CONT40 × route × fuel-surcharge formula) maps to existing pricing tables; the fuel-surcharge-formula column is the trickiest — document the formula. |
| THÔNG TIN CẢNG BÃI (ports/yards) | `ports` | Representable. 17 entries → `ports`. |
| DS NHÂN SỰ (personnel) | `drivers` (drivers) + `users` (office staff logins) | Drivers representable. Office staff (Giám đốc, PGĐ, Kế hoạch, Kế toán, Cus, Ops) are ~20 people — we seed drivers only; office logins stay as the existing accounts (D4). |
| MẪU DEBIT LONG MINH (debit-note layout) | `debit_note_templates` + `billing_documents` | Representable. The 20-column Long Minh layout (NHÀ MÁY, NHẬP/XUẤT, SỐ BILL, SỐ TỜ KHAI, container, PHÍ DỊCH VỤ split, PHÍ CHI HỘ with vendor breakdown, VAT 8%) maps to the dynamic template + billing-document lines. |

### Dispatch workflow — CUS-ĐIỀU XE

The customer's CUS-ĐIỀU XE describes a two-section dispatch screen:

- **MỤC 1 — BẢNG KẾ HOẠCH XE** (planning): customer, factory, bill, shipping
  line, total qty, weight, customs cutoff, NÂNG/HẢ ports, closing time,
  IMPORT/EXPORT, delivery point, cont type, notes, return date, carrier.
- **MỤC 2 — BẢNG HIỂN THỊ CHI TIẾT CUS** (detailed container-level view) +
  **BẢNG NHẬP THÔNG TIN HÀNG** (create-new-lot form).

The app's shipment workspace (`plans/260729-1908-shipment-operations-workspace`,
completed) implements `shipments` + `shipment_containers` with most of these
fields. **Gap:** the two-pane planning-vs-detail view and the exact column order
are a UI-organization gap, not a data-model gap. Document as such.

## Implementation Steps

1. Create `docs/customer-workflow-gap-analysis.md`.
2. Write the **report gap matrix** (the 6 rows above), each with: customer
   columns → app column/field → status (Yes/Partial/No) → gap → recommended
   home plan (`260730-2232-customer-service-finance-workflow`).
3. Write the **master-data representability table** (above), marking NHÀ MÁY
   and office-staff as documented representability gaps.
4. Write the **dispatch workflow** comparison (CUS-ĐIỀU XE vs shipment
   workspace).
5. Add a **"Deferred to separate plans"** section listing the missing/partial
