3. Run for real: `make seed:customer`. Save full output to
   `qa/2026-07-31_local-reseed_seed.log`.
4. Verify counts with Drizzle/`psql` queries:
   - `users` row count unchanged (≈9 logins).
   - `drivers` ≈ 28; `trucks` ≈ 35 (the seeded BKS fleet); `customers` /
     `suppliers` / `ports` / `routes` match the Excel counts.
   - `shipments` ≈ 5-10, none `LOCKED`.
   - `billing_documents` empty (no fabricated postings).
5. Login smoke check: hit `/api/auth/login` with `admin/admin123` and
   `laixe/admin123`; confirm 200 + token. Optionally open
   http://localhost:7174 and spot-check Dashboard, Phân xe, Chuyến đi, Tài chính
   render with the new data.
6. Update `HANDOFF.md`: status, artifacts, next step (Phase 4).

## Related Code Files

- Run: `backend/src/seed-customer.ts` (from Phase 2)
- Read: `Makefile`
- Create: `qa/2026-07-31_local-reseed_dry-run.log`,
  `qa/2026-07-31_local-reseed_seed.log`

## Success Criteria

- [ ] `make seed:customer` exits 0 locally.
- [ ] Dry-run and real-run outputs saved under `qa/`.
- [ ] `users` count unchanged; `admin` + `laixe` still authenticate.
- [ ] Business tables repopulated with customer data; no `LOCKED` trips.
- [ ] Spot-check of 3 core pages renders without error.

## Risk Assessment

- **Risk:** Running before Phase 2 is green. **Mitigation:** hard dependency on
  Phase 2; do not start until the script is committed and idempotent.
- **Risk:** A local DB with user-created test data gets wiped. **Mitigation:**
  local dev is the designated scratch environment; the wipe list excludes
  `users`. Any locally-created business records are demo data by definition.
</file>

