# Phase 5: QA & Evidence

## Overview

Run the closed-loop SDLC QA gates against everything the plan touched, and
collect all artifacts under `qa/` per the AGENTS.md convention. Because this
plan is mostly a seed script + docs (no API/RBAC/schema change to **product**
behavior), the gate scope is narrower than a feature build — but it is not
skipped.

## Scope decision (per AGENTS.md "scope each QA run to what the change touches")

This plan **adds** `backend/src/seed-customer.ts` + `backend/src/seed/*` and a
docs file. It does **not** change API routes, RBAC, Drizzle schema
migrations, or financial calculations in `shared/src/calculations/`. Therefore:

| Gate | Run? | Why |
|------|------|-----|
| Lint (root) | ✅ | New TS files must lint clean. |
| Backend typecheck | ✅ | Seed script must compile. |
| Backend tests | ✅ | Ensure the new seed module doesn't break imports/compile of the test suite. Add a small test for the wipe order + one round-trip seed on a test DB if feasible. |
