| Frontend tests | ⏭️ | No frontend code touched. |
| Build (`make build`) | ✅ | Seed script must be in the buildable surface. |
| E2E | ⏭️ | No API/flow/RBAC/schema change. (Staging spot-checks in Phase 4 are manual evidence, not the E2E suite.) |

