The remaining notification referenced test user IDs 157-160. The failed cleanup left the child process pending; `trip-shipment.test.ts` was canceled in this combined command, then passed independently as recorded above. This is a test-isolation/cleanup failure rather than a failed Q15 financial assertion, but it is still a red affected gate and cannot be hidden under the repository's closed-loop rules.

