## Implementation Steps

1. Freeze the current authority map in writing, using the existing shipment, billing, receivable, allocation, payable, and dashboard services as the starting point.
2. Close D1: record whether the legal invoice is reference-only or define the one-posting replacement/alias lifecycle before any adapter is specified.
