- Keep finance approvals under existing maker-checker and governance actions, not direct client mutation.
- Any treasury source must be protected as finance data, not exposed through customer or clerk scopes.

## Rollback / Next Steps

- Roll back by disabling any new invoice-adapter or treasury-aware writes while leaving core shipment and billing data intact.
- Revert additive schema only with a tested reverse migration after confirming no production rows depend on it.
- Hand Phase 2 an approved shipment-interaction contract and Phase 3 an approved invoice-handoff contract.
- If the invoice or treasury decision cannot be closed, stop downstream implementation rather than guessing.
