## Implementation Steps

1. Complete D3-INV and freeze the provider-neutral boundary.
2. Characterize current approved-source, lifecycle, portal, and AR behavior.
3. Add the read-only recoverable eligibility projection.
4. Enforce approved/current/same-customer/single-claim sources transactionally.
5. Compose the CUS queue and accountant Debit Note governance surfaces.
