- The controller, not a subagent, updates `HANDOFF.md` and runs
  `pnpm context:check`.
- Handoff must distinguish: code complete, migrations applied, backfill
  complete, mode activated, browser verified, source pushed, and production
  acceptance. Never collapse them into “deployed.”

## Success Criteria

- [ ] Backend policy, service row scope, auth capabilities, frontend routes,
