| Modify | `backend/src/routes/driver.ts` | Task detail, milestone, complete endpoints | Driver ownership/RBAC |
| Modify | `backend/src/services/driver.service.ts` | Extend the existing progress authority with ordered task-aware milestones | Service tests |
| Modify | `backend/src/services/trip-status-machine.service.ts` | Narrow owned-driver completion path | Financial/lifecycle tests |
| Modify | `backend/src/services/notification.service.ts` | Driver task URLs and read state | Notification tests |
| Create | `backend/src/services/trip-pod.service.ts` | Driver-owned version/create/upload/submit readiness | POD/ownership tests |
| Modify | `backend/src/routes/upload.ts` | Private POD file preparation/commit | Upload/authz |
| Modify | `shared/src/schemas/index.ts` | Driver task/progress/POD/complete contracts | Shared tests |
| Modify | `frontend/src/pages/DriverTripDetailPage.tsx` and `frontend/src/pages/driver/` | Task detail/list and status flow | Frontend |
| Modify | `frontend/src/lib/notificationClient.ts` | Deep-link and read behavior | Frontend |
