## Exact Interface Checklist

- [x] Extend `recordDriverProgress()` with fulfillment ID, sequence validation, idempotency, and expected trip version.
- [x] `getDriverFulfillmentDetail(userId, fulfillmentId)` **(proposed)** returns an allowlisted task/site snapshot.
