   - `CUSTOMER`-typed external-carrier trips still post `EXTERNAL_CARRIER_COST`
     to `CARRIER` unchanged (regression guard; D1 — no phantom SUPPLIER test).
   - AP capture failure (inject hash-compute fault) leaves `apCostHash=null,
     apSnapshotDirty=true`, trip still reaches COMPLETED (D11).
   - Edit a cost on a completed trip → assert BOTH `arSnapshotDirty` and
     `apSnapshotDirty` flip true **atomically** (D12); `listDirty()` includes
     the trip; `recapture()` clears both.
   - Edit only `driverSalary` → `apSnapshotDirty` does NOT flip (D14).
6. **Cross-phase integration test.** A single trip that exercises: fuel
   surcharge at create (P3) + a lift expense auto-priced (P2) + completion
   capturing AR + AP (P4) + the supplier's terms resolved correctly on the
   payable (P1). This is the "whole O2C rev1" smoke test.
7. **E2E.** Extend the dispatch/accountant E2E specs to cover the three
   user-visible flows (Ops auto-fill, surcharge on trip, AP dirty queue +
   recapture). Run `cd e2e && ./run_all.sh`.
8. **QA gates + artifacts.** Run every gate in `AGENTS.md`, saving each
   command's full output under `qa/` with the naming convention. If any
   gate is red, enter the fix-loop (Fix → Re-QA → save re-run artifact);
   the loop closes only when all gates are green.
9. **Review report.** Re-read the full diff as a reviewer (or hand off to
   `code-reviewer` for non-trivial cross-module changes per `AGENTS.md`).
   Save the report as `qa/2026-08-02_o2c-rev1_review.md`. Address any
   findings, re-run affected gates, save re-run artifacts.
10. **Knowledge base.** Per `AGENTS.md`, run the incremental `.ua/` update
    if the `Stop` hook reports staleness (the schema additions are
    structural changes the graph must reflect).

## Success Criteria

- [ ] Every pre-existing test that broke on the schema/ledger change is
      updated to the new correct expectation (none skipped, none weakened).
- [ ] 5 new integration test files pass, covering each phase + the
      cross-phase smoke.
- [ ] **Runner-verification (D18):** the new test files are picked up by
      the runner — verify `pnpm test` (or the backend test command) reports
