- [ ] `cd backend && pnpm test` → all pass (artifact saved).
- [ ] `cd frontend && npx tsc -b` → 0 errors (artifact saved).
- [ ] `cd frontend && pnpm test` → all pass (artifact saved).
- [ ] `make build` → succeeds (artifact saved).
- [ ] `cd e2e && ./run_all.sh` → all pass (artifact saved).
- [ ] `qa/2026-08-02_o2c-rev1_review.md` exists with reviewer sign-off (or
