- [ ] `.ua/` knowledge graph is current for the committed HEAD (Stop-hook
      instruction honored).

## Risk Assessment

- **Medium.** The highest risk is the real `VENDOR_EXPENSE` posting fix
  (Phase 4 D2) rippling into existing ledger/aging/E2E assertions that
  hard-coded the old "no supplier-payable row at completion" behavior.
